6. Keeping in mind the observations made by this Court and the award passed by the SLAO,
Reference Court and also by this Court, I am of the considered opinion that it is just and - 16 - NC: 2024:KHC-K:2980 appropriate to award the same compensation of Rs.3,05,434/- per acre with all statutory benefits as against Rs.72,000/- per acre awarded by the First Appellate Court.
Accordingly, I proceed to pass the following:
ORDER (a) Appeals are allowed in part with proportionate costs;
(b) Appellants are entitled for compensation at Rs.3,05,434/- per acre with all statutory benefits in respect of their lands as shown in the statement at paragraph No.2 of this Judgment;
